# Environment variables. Create a `.env` file in the repo root and set the ones you need.
# None of these are required for `make test`, `make verify` or `make duel-dry` (no Docker, no API key).
#
# Required for LIVE / PAID runs only:
#   NEBIUS_API_KEY   your Nebius Token Factory API key. Runtime model calls go to Token Factory
#                    (see config/models.yaml); create a key in the Token Factory console.
#
# Optional:
#   NEBIUS_BASE_URL  overrides the default https://api.tokenfactory.nebius.com/v1/ (a regional
#                    endpoint also exists, e.g. https://api.tokenfactory.us-central1.nebius.com/v1/).
#   ANTHROPIC_API_KEY / ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL   optional alternative provider
#                    (make_router(provider="anthropic")). One provider per run: the Anthropic lane is
#                    a separate, pre-registered experiment arm, never silently mixed with Nebius.
#
# Set each as  NAME=value  (one per line) in your .env file.
